 {
     accountCycles(cycles);
+    // GOW-Port: pacing keeps the EE clock from running ahead of the host clock; this keeps it from falling behind. With
+    // 16 cycles per checkpoint, long stretches of EE work (leaving a movie, loading a menu) accrued less guest time than
